{"4932510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mùa Hình (Trading-cards Season)", "steam_appid": 4932510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4944030], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you still remember the last time you played childhood outdoor games? “Crocodile on the shore”, “Blind man’s bluff”, hopscotch, sack race, paper plane throwing… those games once filled our childhood with laughter, but have now gradually faded away.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop Thiec Game wants to bring back that feeling once more, but in a fresher way. We’ve transformed traditional folk games into a video game called <i>Trading-Cards Season</i>: fun yet nostalgic, so you can play with friends and kids right on your computer or phone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>MAIN FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of Minigames:</strong> Relive familiar childhood games with rules “digitized” into thrilling and hilarious challenges. Currently featuring 10 minigames, with more to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/9a46e57d8c4726d23c0f2fea1f6f53dc.poster.avif?t=1784370799\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/9a46e57d8c4726d23c0f2fea1f6f53dc.webm?t=1784370799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/9a46e57d8c4726d23c0f2fea1f6f53dc.mp4?t=1784370799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/47d8c74f9925165b1808749f43075414.poster.avif?t=1784370799\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/47d8c74f9925165b1808749f43075414.webm?t=1784370799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/47d8c74f9925165b1808749f43075414.mp4?t=1784370799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tournament Mode:</strong> Compete through 5–7 minigames in a row to accumulate points. Suspense until the very end, with last-second comebacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/7110009dad2f9d91a2552dbdf9f01041.poster.avif?t=1784370799\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/7110009dad2f9d91a2552dbdf9f01041.webm?t=1784370799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/7110009dad2f9d91a2552dbdf9f01041.mp4?t=1784370799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fun Multiplayer:</strong> Supports 2–4 players. Invite your friends to an online room to battle for titles, rare items, or sharpen reflexes against Bots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection:</strong> Gather nostalgic toys and items (from the 80s and 90s). See them again in a fresh, lasting way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/a4bff91c8b62f56d6e0d1253cabd270e.poster.avif?t=1784370799\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/a4bff91c8b62f