aturing 10 minigames, with more to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/9a46e57d8c4726d23c0f2fea1f6f53dc.poster.avif?t=1784370799\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/9a46e57d8c4726d23c0f2fea1f6f53dc.webm?t=1784370799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/9a46e57d8c4726d23c0f2fea1f6f53dc.mp4?t=1784370799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/47d8c74f9925165b1808749f43075414.poster.avif?t=1784370799\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/47d8c74f9925165b1808749f43075414.webm?t=1784370799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/47d8c74f9925165b1808749f43075414.mp4?t=1784370799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tournament Mode:</strong> Compete through 5–7 minigames in a row to accumulate points. Suspense until the very end, with last-second comebacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/7110009dad2f9d91a2552dbdf9f01041.poster.avif?t=1784370799\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4932510/extras/7110009dad2f9d91a2552dbdf9f01041.webm?t=1784370799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><